g your controls; every l","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T04:10:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114041179","verified_at":"2026-10-25T07:03:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5172860-1847286114035871","game_id":"steam-5172860","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo v1.41: Formations, damage-number toggle & fixes","summary":"Demo v1.41 is a small update that unlocks formations and smooths out the experience. Thanks to everyone who reported issues, especially in our QQ group and Steam Discussions! What's new Formations are now available. Once Yan Zheng joins you, press F to switch your skeleton army's formation, with different layouts and small bonuses. Switching has a cooldown. A damage-number toggle. The new Damage Numbers setting is on by default. Turn it off to hide numbers from regular hits; changes take effect ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T10:38:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114035871","verified_at":"2026-10-23T11:00:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5172860-1847286114033780","game_id":"steam-5172860","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo v1.40: skill upgrades, new area & story cutscenes","summary":"Demo v1.40 is a substantial content update, with new ways to develop Gu Gui's skills and more to discover along the journey. Thank you to everyone who has tried Necro Rising during Steam Next Fest! What's new Upgrade Gu Gui's Taoist skills. Each of his five skills now has two upgrade levels in the Bone Forge's new Rites tab, paid for with souls and materials, with no Soul Crystals required; the second level unlocks after clearing the North Pass. The first improves stats, while the second adds vi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T18:11:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114033780","verified_at":"2026-10-22T18:51:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5172860-1847286114030410","game_id":"steam-5172860","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo v1.31: translation fixes for 12 languages","summary":"Demo v1.31 fixes translation display issues in the 12 languages other than Simplified Chinese and English. What's new More text in your chosen language. Updated combat messages and callouts, quest objectives in areas such as the Fogmire, camp and building prompts, character nameplates, Bone Forge material names and missing-material messages, and minigame objectives and controls. These texts now use your chosen language instead of English, or Simplified Chinese when playing in Traditional Chinese","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T21:38:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114030410","verified_at":"2026-10-22T02:42:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5172860-1847286114028945","game_id":"steam-5172860","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo v1.30: 12 new languages and clearer corpses","summary":"Demo v1.30 adds 12 new languages, clearer corpses and a smoother lamp minigame. Thanks to everyone trying Necro Rising during Steam Next Fest and sharing feedback. What's new 12 new languages. Alongside Simplified Chinese and English, you can now play in 繁體中文, 日本語, 한국어, Русский, Français, Deutsch, Español, Português (Brasil), Polski, Türkçe, Magyar and Ελληνικά, and the English text has been polished. The game picks your Steam / system language on first launch, and you can switch any time under ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T13:59:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114028945","verified_at":"2026-10-21T15:43:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5172860-1846651706694445","game_id":"steam-5172860","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo v1.21: automatic language on first launch","summary":"Demo v1.21 is a small language update: on first launch, the game now selects Chinese or English automatically if no language setting has been saved. Language selection uses your Steam language first, or your system language if Steam language is unavailable. Chinese settings select Chinese; other languages default to English. Saved language settings are kept. The language option is easier to find: open the title menu and choose Settings / 语言. The game version is now 1.21. Found something unclear?","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T09:31:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706694445","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:53:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5172860-1846651706694107","game_id":"steam-5172860","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo v1.20: clearer enemies, more breathing room","summary":"Demo v1.20 makes enemies easier to spot, gives you more room among your troops, and tidies up a few details along the road. Thanks to everyone who has tried Necro Rising during Next Fest and shared feedback with us. {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46291654/d9523bf29cd79699cccb8dffbef3369a88813206.png What's new Clearer friend and foe. Enemies now have warm orange outlines and matching overhead health bars, while elites have a broken orange ring beneath their feet. Shieldbearers, captains, berserkers and sent","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T07:47:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706694107","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:53:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5172860-1846651706688880","game_id":"steam-5172860","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Reworked Bosses, Difficulty Select, New Rite Names","summary":"Next Fest is almost here, and this is our last big update before it. Thank you to everyone who has played, commented and wishlisted. Boss fights reworked The Bone-Butcher, the Lantern-Hung and other bosses now use a new boss system: every big move has a clear wind-up, damage windows open when you create an opening, and you can no longer kite them down for free. Bosses call out their moves and show phase titles and phase marks on their health bar. When a boss walks behind a building, the building","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T05:27:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706688880","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:53:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5172860-1846651706675598","game_id":"steam-5172860","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Soul Champions & Beacon Flames","summary":"Update · In-game version 1.10 Thank you for playing the Necro Rising: Rebirth demo! This update introduces Soul Champions you can muster and upgrade, alongside improvements to the North Pass, the Fogmire, story pacing and ambush encounters. New Content Soul Champions join your legion: At the start of Chapter 3, A'Zhen introduces the Bone Forge's \"Muster\" feature. Use materials gathered in battle to muster and upgrade the Glaive Guard and the Divine-Arm Crossbow. Badly wounded Soul Champions retu","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T21:04:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706675598","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:53:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5172860-1846018067937878","game_id":"steam-5172860","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: The Northern Pass and the Mire Are Open","summary":"Thank you for playing the Necro Rising: Rebirth demo. This is the biggest demo update so far: New Two new chapters: Chapter 3, the Northern Pass, and Chapter 4, the Mire apothecary. The demo now covers the prologue and the first four chapters, about 1–1.5 hours. New companions: Yan Zheng, a blade captain of the Pass, and Shen Zhi, the physician of the Mire. Formations: through Yan Zheng's companion story, you gradually learn to form ranks — Arrowhead to break their lines, Ring Wall to guard your","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-11T06:24:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067937878","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:53:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5172860-1845383656380558","game_id":"steam-5172860","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo 1.0: Necro Rising has been relaunched","summary":"Necro Rising has been rebuilt from the ground up.The earlier four-chapter campaign and Tide Rush modes have been retired. The game has been remade around Return: a new dark Eastern fantasy story, full Chinese voice-over, ink-wash story illustrations and redrawn pixel characters. Raising the fallen into your legion is still at its heart, now joined by calling the dead home and rebuilding your camp. Free Demo 1.0 is the first build of the relaunched game, and it is available now.The storyBetrayed ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T09:43:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656380558","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:53:50Z","discovery_method":"of